# heavy-gate volumes: extra volumes whose free space gates a start, one absolute mount point per line. '#' lines and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Every start already needs the volume that holds $HOME to have HEAVY_GATE_MIN_FREE_GB free (15 by default). Each volume listed here must
# meet the same floor. A listed volume that is not mounted refuses the start with "REFUSED: <path> is not mounted; mount it and retry"
# and exit 76; it is never skipped. No file, or no line, watches nothing extra.
#
# /Volumes/Workshop holds agent scratch (AGENT_TMP), the T3 worktrees, the pnpm store and the Docker disk. It exists only on the personal Mac.
/Volumes/Workshop
